{
  "about": "How a drive's free percent reads. `formatFreePercent` (free-percent.test.ts) must produce `text` (the status bar, minimum zero decimals) and `toastText` (the low-disk-space warning, minimum one decimal), and the backend's emit gate (`src-tauri/src/space_poller/readout.rs`) must truncate to the same figure, so the two can't drift. en-US digits.",
